{%- comment -%} FAQ (answers match the live PDP FAQ and policies). Param: extra (bool) adds the "which drum" question. {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="sec" id="ms-faq" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-rv><p class="k">Questions</p><h2>Before you <em>wrap it.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      {%- if extra -%}
      <details><summary>Which drum should I choose?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>For a stocking filler or a first drum, The Pocket Drum (M) (4-inch). For Mom or Grandma, The Pro Drum (L) (6-inch) is our main gift: eleven numbered notes, a guide book and six free extras. For the biggest, deepest sound, The Plus Drum (XL) (10-inch).</p></div></details>
      {%- endif -%}
      <details><summary>How fast will it arrive?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Each drum ships within 2–3 days with free tracking and insurance. Expect it at your door in 5–10 business days.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I send it straight to them?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Enter their address as the delivery address at checkout and we’ll ship it straight to them.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>I can’t read music. Will I manage?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Every note is numbered and in the same scale, so nothing sounds wrong. The 6-inch and 10-inch come with a guide book where every song is written as numbers.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Is it easy for older hands?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. The notes are wide and numbered, and a light tap with the soft mallet or a fingertip is enough.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can it live outside?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>It’s made to be played by the rain. Wipe it dry afterwards and bring it in for frost, snow and storms.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Is it loud?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>No. It has a soft, bell-like tone you’ll hear on the patio without it carrying down the street.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What if they don’t love it?<span class="pm">{% render 'ms-ic', i: 'plus', s: 14 %}</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Return it within 30 days of delivery for a full refund of the item price. Email support@madespecial.store with your order number to start.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
